From u96353e7106735838 at groups.google.com  Wed Feb 27 15:43:14 2019
From: u96353e7106735838 at groups.google.com (Karl Broman)
Date: Wed, 27 Feb 2019 15:43:14 +0000
Subject: Re: Can we run orderMarkers command using multi-core for larger marker data?
Message-ID: <DCSDoNcQ3oA.w4iUOoJEBgAJ@rqtl-disc.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <DCSDoNcQ3oA.Em6yqwkKBQAJ@rqtl-disc.groups.google.com>
References: <DCSDoNcQ3oA.Em6yqwkKBQAJ@rqtl-disc.groups.google.com>
